    "id": "open-letter",
    "title": "An Open Letter to Malaysian Undergrads About AI",
    "dek": "RM89 an hour for a lecture, competing against a RM90-a-month tool that never sleeps. A Ground Truth briefing.",
    "kicker": "Open Letter",
